WEBVTT

00:01.418 --> 00:02.794
Blood Demon Arts.

00:03.503 --> 00:04.629
Exploding Blood!

00:12.721 --> 00:15.223
No one can break

00:15.974 --> 00:19.519
my bond with Nezuko!

02:16.344 --> 02:17.512
Nezuko.

02:18.388 --> 02:19.889
Nezuko!

02:22.433 --> 02:23.893
I won.

02:23.977 --> 02:25.186
I beat him.

02:26.396 --> 02:28.231
Dad helped me.

02:29.607 --> 02:32.193
Somehow, our family heirloom,
the kagura dance,

02:32.277 --> 02:34.529
helped me to unleash this move.

02:35.155 --> 02:37.824
But anyway, it helped me

02:38.449 --> 02:39.659
and I could beat him.

02:44.664 --> 02:45.707
What?

02:46.416 --> 02:48.001
Nezuko looks blurry.

02:49.002 --> 02:51.421
Is it because I took too many breaths?

02:55.216 --> 02:56.718
My ear is ringing so hard.

02:57.635 --> 03:00.388
It's painful all over my body.

03:02.223 --> 03:03.266
I must

03:03.850 --> 03:05.768
recover fast.

03:07.520 --> 03:10.982
I have to keep fighting.

03:11.816 --> 03:13.860
I must save Inosuke.

03:14.819 --> 03:15.987
Quickly!

03:20.366 --> 03:22.410
The smell of blood is getting stronger.

03:23.786 --> 03:25.121
Which reminds me…

03:25.204 --> 03:27.457
I don't smell the ashes.

03:29.125 --> 03:30.084
Could it be…

03:34.339 --> 03:36.049
I clearly chopped his head off.

03:37.175 --> 03:39.677
Do you think you can defeat me?

03:39.761 --> 03:41.387
What a pity.

03:41.471 --> 03:44.349
Are you feeling happy
in that pathetic delusion of yours?

03:45.225 --> 03:48.353
I severed my head with my thread

03:49.270 --> 03:52.065
before you could chop off my head.

03:53.441 --> 03:54.943
That's it.

03:55.026 --> 03:57.153
I'm going to kill you and your sister.

03:57.987 --> 04:01.324
I've never been so angry for so long.

04:02.659 --> 04:03.576
Stand up.

04:03.660 --> 04:04.869
Stand up now.

04:05.828 --> 04:07.705
Adjust your breath.

04:07.789 --> 04:09.707
Quickly! Hurry!

04:10.416 --> 04:14.754
How on earth did you not get burnt?

04:14.837 --> 04:17.548
Only me and my threads got burnt.

04:18.091 --> 04:20.802
Is it because of your sister?

04:20.885 --> 04:23.179
But thanks to you, I'm getting irritated.

04:24.931 --> 04:28.643
I can break you into pieces
without the slightest regrets.

04:30.019 --> 04:31.646
If I use the correct breathing technique,

04:31.729 --> 04:34.148
it'll make no difference
because of how exhausted I am.

04:35.358 --> 04:36.985
Blood Demon Arts.

04:37.068 --> 04:38.236
Murderous Eye Basket.

04:41.406 --> 04:42.657
Don't be impatient.

04:42.740 --> 04:44.325
Keep your breath in check.

04:44.409 --> 04:45.576
Calm down.

04:45.660 --> 04:46.828
Just calm down.

04:48.579 --> 04:51.082
I can't raise my hand.

05:04.345 --> 05:05.596
Someone is coming.

05:06.431 --> 05:07.557
Is it Zenitsu?

05:10.393 --> 05:13.104
You did a good job holding out
until I got here.

05:15.606 --> 05:16.941
Leave the rest to me.

05:19.652 --> 05:21.779
One after another,

05:21.863 --> 05:24.991
human scums
just keep on getting in my way!

05:25.074 --> 05:26.576
Blood Demon Arts.

05:31.998 --> 05:33.624
Cutting Thread Rotation.

05:36.085 --> 05:37.628
Total Concentration Breathing.

05:37.712 --> 05:38.921
Breath of Water.

05:39.505 --> 05:40.965
Eleventh Form.

05:43.259 --> 05:44.343
Dead Calm.

05:45.344 --> 05:47.346
Eleventh Form?

05:47.430 --> 05:50.016
So what even if it's Eleventh Form?

05:52.852 --> 05:53.770
What?

05:56.564 --> 05:58.566
What? What did he do?

05:59.567 --> 06:03.488
The moment my threads got near him,
they all snapped.

06:04.864 --> 06:06.783
Not a single thread caught him?

06:07.658 --> 06:10.036
Did he just cut the toughest threads?

06:11.370 --> 06:13.289
This can't be happening!

06:13.372 --> 06:14.415
One more time!

06:25.093 --> 06:27.762
I've made a mistake!

06:28.387 --> 06:32.141
I've been the only one
who did no wrong all along

06:32.809 --> 06:34.977
in this pretend family.

06:46.197 --> 06:48.032
We got you now.

06:49.242 --> 06:50.576
Hey. Look over there.

06:59.794 --> 07:00.878
Is it a demon?

07:00.962 --> 07:02.463
A kid demon.

07:02.547 --> 07:05.883
He may look like a child,
but he's still a demon.

07:06.509 --> 07:08.928
If we let him be, he'll eat someone.

07:09.720 --> 07:10.721
Hey.

07:11.305 --> 07:12.306
Hey.

07:12.390 --> 07:13.766
Do you want me to save you?

07:16.436 --> 07:19.939
Are you willing to listen to my request?

07:20.648 --> 07:22.024
Yes, I'll do anything!

07:22.108 --> 07:24.527
I'll do as you say! So just save me!

07:25.111 --> 07:28.114
Well, will you be part of my family?

07:28.197 --> 07:29.991
Yes, I will!

07:30.074 --> 07:31.742
What are you talking about?

07:32.618 --> 07:34.579
Now, prepare yourself.

08:11.407 --> 08:12.658
Welcome.

08:13.409 --> 08:17.038
From now on, you are part of my family.

08:34.722 --> 08:35.973
Drink this.

08:36.057 --> 08:39.602
Our whole family obtained
our powers from Rui.

08:41.020 --> 08:43.147
We were all weak demons.

08:43.231 --> 08:45.358
We received our powers from Rui.

08:46.275 --> 08:48.945
That person favored Rui so much

08:49.028 --> 08:52.156
that he allowed him to do so.

09:03.751 --> 09:05.044
Do you feel it?

09:05.836 --> 09:08.923
You don't have to fear
demon slayers anymore.

09:10.633 --> 09:13.553
Well then, on to our final step.

09:31.737 --> 09:33.781
Lift your head.

09:38.202 --> 09:39.245
Congratulations.

09:39.870 --> 09:41.831
You're now a real member of my family.

10:14.322 --> 10:16.073
We are just a pretend family.

10:17.783 --> 10:19.785
We weren't related by blood.

10:19.869 --> 10:21.787
We are a family
that is being put together.

10:22.455 --> 10:23.831
I'm sorry!

10:24.373 --> 10:25.625
I won't mess up again.

10:25.708 --> 10:28.127
I'll work harder, Rui!

10:28.210 --> 10:29.420
Please forgive me.

10:29.503 --> 10:30.463
I'm sorry.

10:30.546 --> 10:32.131
I didn't try hard enough.

10:32.798 --> 10:35.593
Sometimes, I turn back to normal.

10:44.935 --> 10:47.146
Don't give me excuses, Mom.

10:50.775 --> 10:52.985
Be a good mom for me.

10:53.527 --> 10:55.696
I understand, Rui.

10:58.282 --> 11:00.493
We're all afraid of demon slayers.

11:00.576 --> 11:02.495
We just wanted some comrades.

11:04.664 --> 11:09.794
In fact, I didn't sign up to play
this baffling pretend family game.

11:10.461 --> 11:14.256
But whoever disobeys
Rui's demands or orders

11:14.340 --> 11:17.885
will be cut into shreds,
stripped off their minds,

11:17.968 --> 11:20.221
and hanged to be exposed to the sun.

11:21.013 --> 11:22.556
I can't take it anymore.

11:24.308 --> 11:27.061
I'll pretend I didn't hear that.

11:27.144 --> 11:29.480
You're not that stupid, are you?

11:30.231 --> 11:32.274
You're different from the rest.

11:34.151 --> 11:35.486
Let's escape.

11:38.114 --> 11:40.324
It's because of you that I could say this.

11:41.283 --> 11:45.329
I'm treating only you like my real sister.

11:54.004 --> 11:58.175
Tomorrow, the lord
will summon Rui downhill.

11:59.135 --> 12:01.053
That's when we can run for it.

12:37.465 --> 12:38.883
Too bad.

13:02.448 --> 13:05.409
They may be fools, but I'm not.

13:06.035 --> 13:08.370
But I still made a mistake!

13:11.624 --> 13:13.667
Rui.

13:14.293 --> 13:15.794
Mom got killed.

13:16.337 --> 13:18.255
I think our big brother
got killed as well.

13:18.881 --> 13:20.341
What should we do?

13:20.424 --> 13:22.635
The demon slayers are coming.

13:24.303 --> 13:25.262
Hey.

13:27.389 --> 13:29.308
Should we escape?

13:32.144 --> 13:33.103
No.

13:35.773 --> 13:37.274
You should have known.

13:38.526 --> 13:42.363
I hate it when you turn your face
back to normal.

13:46.325 --> 13:48.118
What are you looking at?

13:48.202 --> 13:50.037
There's nothing to see here.

13:53.207 --> 13:56.877
I was lucky to get away
with just scratches on my face.

13:59.129 --> 14:00.089
A demon!

14:03.175 --> 14:04.343
What the hell?

14:06.470 --> 14:07.596
It's useless.

14:07.680 --> 14:09.181
You can't cut it.

14:09.265 --> 14:13.519
My yarn may look soft,
but it is indeed tenacious.

14:16.063 --> 14:19.859
First, the solvent will dissolve
the clothes out of the way.

14:20.568 --> 14:22.778
And then, it will dissolve you.

14:22.862 --> 14:26.282
You're going to be my glutinous meal
in no time.

14:27.616 --> 14:29.159
You're amazing.

14:29.243 --> 14:31.954
You can make threads with your hands.

14:33.247 --> 14:34.540
Good evening.

14:35.708 --> 14:37.835
The moon is beautiful tonight.

14:52.266 --> 14:56.312
Looks like you don't want
to get along with me.

14:56.395 --> 14:59.064
Wait.

14:59.148 --> 15:00.482
Please!

15:00.566 --> 15:03.986
I had to do it because I was ordered.

15:04.069 --> 15:06.864
If I resist, I'll be cut into shreds.

15:08.324 --> 15:09.950
I see.

15:10.034 --> 15:11.785
That's a pity.

15:11.869 --> 15:13.412
I can help you.

15:13.495 --> 15:15.080
Can we get along?

15:15.164 --> 15:18.083
Are you going to help me?

15:18.167 --> 15:19.293
Yes.

15:19.376 --> 15:21.545
But in order for us to get along,

15:21.629 --> 15:23.756
I have a few questions for you.

15:25.674 --> 15:27.801
My sweet lady,

15:27.885 --> 15:30.346
how many people have you killed?

15:31.764 --> 15:32.765
Five.

15:36.769 --> 15:40.022
But I was under his command,
so I can't help it.

15:40.773 --> 15:43.525
You don't have to lie to me

15:43.609 --> 15:45.027
because I know it all.

15:45.778 --> 15:49.365
-I'm amazed by your spell that turned
-Help me!

15:49.448 --> 15:51.075
one of our men into a cocoon.

15:51.158 --> 15:53.369
You ate 80 people, right?

15:53.953 --> 15:56.246
I didn't eat that many people.

15:56.330 --> 15:58.207
I only killed five.

15:58.749 --> 16:01.460
I came here from the west, you know.

16:02.211 --> 16:04.588
My sweet lady, I said west.

16:05.255 --> 16:10.260
I came here as I saw cocoons
hanging in the west of the mountain.

16:11.053 --> 16:16.141
And those trapped in the cocoons
have all died and liquified.

16:16.225 --> 16:20.229
In that spot alone,
I counted at least 14 cocoons.

16:21.271 --> 16:24.066
Fourteen people had died in it.

16:24.858 --> 16:27.403
But I'm not angry at you.

16:27.486 --> 16:30.823
I'm only here to verify
the actual death toll.

16:31.448 --> 16:33.617
Why do you have to do that?

16:34.451 --> 16:39.039
You're going to be penalized accordingly
and be reborn!

16:39.123 --> 16:40.207
Penalized?

16:40.290 --> 16:43.043
That way, we can get along better.

16:43.544 --> 16:47.172
If you're left unpunished
for taking people's lives,

16:47.256 --> 16:49.466
there won't be any closure
for those you killed.

16:50.676 --> 16:53.095
I'm going to gouge out your eyes,

16:53.178 --> 16:56.348
cut your body open
and remove your innards.

16:56.974 --> 17:01.979
For every person you killed,
I shall torture you.

17:02.062 --> 17:05.691
After you suffer that pain and anguish,

17:05.774 --> 17:07.818
you'll be absolved from your crimes.

17:08.360 --> 17:09.987
Let's do our best, okay?

17:11.155 --> 17:12.364
It's okay!

17:12.448 --> 17:14.199
You're a demon.

17:14.283 --> 17:18.037
You won't die or suffer any side effects.

17:18.120 --> 17:20.039
You're kidding me!

17:20.539 --> 17:22.374
Die, you bitch!

17:30.049 --> 17:32.926
It looks like we're never
going to get along.

17:34.344 --> 17:36.263
What a pity.

18:13.884 --> 18:16.720
Breath of the Insect. Butterfly Dance.

18:18.097 --> 18:19.348
Caprice.

18:21.517 --> 18:24.520
My head didn't get chopped off.

18:26.188 --> 18:28.273
That's the blade she's using?

18:28.357 --> 18:29.566
I see.

18:29.650 --> 18:32.069
Her arm isn't strong enough
because of her short stature.

18:32.152 --> 18:33.946
So she couldn't chop off my head.

18:34.446 --> 18:36.073
That means I can beat her.

18:55.676 --> 18:58.095
Even if I didn't chop off your head,

18:58.178 --> 19:00.556
you shouldn't have rest easy.

19:00.639 --> 19:04.017
Because there are demon slayers like me
who use poison.

19:09.815 --> 19:11.692
I'm the Demon Slayer Corps'
Insect Hashira,

19:11.775 --> 19:13.110
Shinobu Kocho.

19:14.319 --> 19:19.616
I may be the only Hashira
who's unable to decapitate demons.

19:19.700 --> 19:22.411
Instead, I make poison
that's lethal to them.

19:22.494 --> 19:24.496
That's quite impressive, don't you think?

19:26.248 --> 19:27.499
I'm sorry.

19:27.583 --> 19:29.835
You didn't hear that because you're dead.

19:30.878 --> 19:32.045
How silly of me.

19:39.178 --> 19:41.096
Are you all right?

19:41.180 --> 19:43.557
Yes, I'll manage.

19:43.640 --> 19:46.101
What about the demon?

19:47.728 --> 19:49.938
Shouldn't you chop her head off?

19:50.856 --> 19:53.525
I killed her with wisteria toxin.

19:53.609 --> 19:56.695
She's already dead,
so she'll just rot away later.

19:57.696 --> 20:00.699
I'm a pharmaceuticals expert!

20:01.408 --> 20:02.826
Your clothes are all dissolved.

20:02.910 --> 20:05.120
But your body is left unscathed.

20:05.204 --> 20:06.330
That's great.

20:10.626 --> 20:11.793
Now then,

20:11.877 --> 20:16.590
I'm curious to know where the demon
who enslaved this lady is.

20:18.091 --> 20:21.053
But it looks like Mr. Tomioka
is already one huge step ahead of me.

20:22.095 --> 20:24.306
Nezuko.

20:27.517 --> 20:30.020
Kill.

20:30.103 --> 20:33.523
I must kill those two.

20:33.607 --> 20:34.900
Siblings…

20:38.403 --> 20:40.864
What are you going to do, Rui?

20:41.365 --> 20:43.242
What is family?

20:44.534 --> 20:45.577
I don't know.

20:46.119 --> 20:49.248
Because I don't have
any memory as a human.

20:50.791 --> 20:54.836
Is that why you're asking us
to pretend to be your family?

20:55.754 --> 20:58.257
I thought that by forming
a bond like a family,

20:58.340 --> 21:00.509
I can recover my memories

21:02.511 --> 21:05.013
and reminisce my bonds
with my real family.

21:11.603 --> 21:12.688
That's right.

21:13.188 --> 21:14.189
I…

21:17.901 --> 21:19.069
Nezuko.

22:52.245 --> 22:53.288
You're amazing!

22:53.371 --> 22:55.248
You can make poison for demons.

22:55.332 --> 22:57.751
I'm a student
of the pharmaceutical sciences.

22:57.834 --> 23:01.630
You don't have to wield a sword
to be a demon slayer.

23:01.713 --> 23:03.131
I see.

23:03.215 --> 23:05.801
Here's a little gossip
from the Taisho era.

23:05.884 --> 23:08.011
My poison is concocted in a scabbard.

23:08.095 --> 23:12.224
Only my swordsmith and I
know how to concoct it.

23:12.307 --> 23:15.310
All right, I'm going to shoot up the ranks
with a unique sword too!

23:15.393 --> 23:19.815
I think you should first train
to keep your uniform from dissolving.

23:19.898 --> 23:21.483
What a poisonous remark.

23:21.566 --> 23:24.069
Next, episode 20, "Against Corps Rules."

23:24.152 --> 23:26.196
It's good to be ambitious.

23:26.279 --> 23:27.364
Let's do our best.

23:27.447 --> 23:28.573
TO BE CONTINUED

23:28.657 --> 23:29.950
Subtitle translation by CL Tan
